-- 634: repair the five drifted cards (Kevin 2026-09-30: "i'd like to get those patched back up and in condition where
-- they produce on brand, kick ass renders for nightly dreams"). Concepts from mig 632. Off-concept spots deactivated after
-- review (Martha's Vineyard beaches, Utah peaks and ski resorts, Romanian gorges, general Rome, Mass Effect / Star Wars /
-- Halo / Expanse places), 7 rescued by hand (Rome's chariot circuses, Poenari, Snagov, Peles), pools rebuilt to ~70 with
-- on-concept spots that graded S/A and passed a duplicate read, then trimmed by hand (Lucca's cafe piazza, mundane
-- station rooms, utilitarian winery rooms, Ogden's 1924 station; "Invented" stripped from the castle spots). Wild West
-- is the old frontier (Kevin: "think the movie tombstone ... or red dead redemption era"), so the three Promontory
-- locomotive spots lose "replica" and "historic grade". Deactivated = is_active false (reversible). Re-runnable.

